90:  *
91:  * <p>The difference between versions 2 and 3 is minor. Version 3 includes operator coordinator
92:  * state for each operator, and drops some minor unused fields.
93:  *
94:  * <p>Basic checkpoint metadata layout:
95:  *
96:  * <pre>
97:  *  +--------------+---------------+-----------------+
98:  *  | checkpointID | master states | operator states |
99:  *  +--------------+---------------+-----------------+
100:  *
101:  *  Master state:
102:  *  +--------------+---------------------+---------+------+---------------+
103:  *  | magic number | num remaining bytes | version | name | payload bytes |
104:  *  +--------------+---------------------+---------+------+---------------+
105:  * </pre>
106:  */
