132:      * Create ByteBufferWritableFSDataOutputStream from specific path which supports to write data
133:      * to ByteBuffer with {@link org.apache.flink.core.fs.FileSystem.WriteMode#OVERWRITE} mode.
134:      *
135:      * @param dbFilePath The file path to write to.
136:      * @return The stream to the new file at the target path.
137:      * @throws IOException Thrown, if the stream could not be opened because of an I/O, or because a
138:      *     file already exists at that path and the write mode indicates to not overwrite the file.
139:      */
